  "description": "<p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;\">At Glow Pups, we believe that every dog deserves to live their best, tail-wagging life.  Based in sunny Southern California, our brand is infused with the vibrant energy and laid-back vibes of the SoCal beaches. </p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;\">Founded by passionate dog lover, Kathy Clarke, Glow pups was born from a deep desire to make dogs feel as special as we do when we shop for ourselves.  We've crated a collection of bright, fun and stylish dog essentials that bring joy and comfort to your furry friends.  </p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;\">Our playful and durable toys are designed to engage and entertain dogs of all sizes, perfect for those energetic pups who love to have fun or the cuddlers who need a new fuzzy buddy to sleep with.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;\">While toys are our best buddies favorite Glow Pups items to shop for, we also offer a wide range of unique dog accessories including stylish braided leashes and collars, cozy, comfy and oh-so-chic beds that offer the perfect retreat after a long day of play and vacuum-insulated bowls that keep water ice cold and food fresh.  </p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;\"><br>• 10% Commission on each sale through the affialiate's unique link<br><br></p>",
